          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Six fifths F–C–G–D–A–E–B are narrowed by 1/6 PC, the other six are pure. A mild well temperament." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sex kvinter F–C–G–D–A–E–B minskas 1/6 PC, övriga sex är rena. Mild välpasserad temperatur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sixth-comma meantone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Medeltonstemperatur 1/6 komma"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Small deviations are tuned directly without overpull." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Små avvikelser stäms direkt utan överdrag."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Standard pitch" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standardstämton"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Started" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Påbörjad"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stretch" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stretch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Survey or measure a few keys in the middle and the app can suggest a reference that suits the piano." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kartlägg eller mät några tangenter i mitten så kan appen föreslå en referens som passar pianot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temperament" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Temperatur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The most common compromise: 4:2 in the middle and treble, 6:3 in the bass." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Den vanligaste kompromissen: 4:2 i mitten och diskanten, 6:3 i basen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The piano was %@ cents from the target in the middle (≈ A4 = %@)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pianot låg %@ cent från målet i mitten (≈ A4 = %@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The piano was close to the target (%@ cents in the middle) when the pass started." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pianot låg nära målet (%@ cent i mitten) när omgången började."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To reach the target: %@ overpull. A key that starts at %@ cents is tuned to %@ (A4 ≈ %@) and settles towards the target as the tension evens out. Check again with a new pass after 2–4 weeks. To avoid raising the pitch, use the piano’s current pitch instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "För att nå målet: %@ överdrag. En tangent som börjar på %@ cent stäms till %@ (A4 ≈ %@) och sjunker mot målet när spänningen jämnas ut. Kontrollera med en ny omgång efter 2–4 veckor. Vill du inte dra upp: använd pianots nuvarande tonhöjd."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tolerance" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tolerans"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Treble" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diskant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tune down to the target, or use the piano’s current pitch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
